<title>JAPAN: Daiwa Bank to brief media on earnings revision.</title>
<headline>Daiwa Bank to brief media on earnings revision.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daiwa Bank Ltd said on Friday that it would brief the media at 3.30 p.m. (0630 GMT) on a revision to its earnings forecast.  </p>
<p>In November, the bank said it expected revenues of 650.0 billion yen and a parent current profit of 24.0 billion yen in the fiscal year through March 1997.</p>
<p>A Daiwa official said earlier on Friday that the bank has outstanding loans of about 750 billion yen to three failed financial firms affiliated with Nippon Credit Bank Ltd.</p>
</text>
